#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:5
msgid ""
"Color-convert is a color conversion library for JavaScript and node. It "
"converts all ways between `rgb`, `hsl`, `hsv`, `hwb`, `cmyk`, `ansi`, "
"`ansi16`, `hex` strings, and CSS `keyword`s (will round to closest):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:19
msgid "Install"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:25
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:27
msgid ""
"Simply get the property of the _from_ and _to_ conversion that you're "
"looking for."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:29
msgid ""
"All functions have a rounded and unrounded variant. By default, return "
"values are rounded. To get the unrounded (raw) results, simply tack on "
"`.raw` to the function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:31
msgid ""
"All 'from' functions have a hidden property called `.channels` that "
"indicates the number of channels the function expects (not including "
"alpha)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:45
msgid "Arrays"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:46
msgid ""
"All functions that accept multiple arguments also support passing an "
"array."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:48
msgid ""
"Note that this does **not** apply to functions that convert from a color "
"that only requires one value (e.g. `keyword`, `ansi256`, `hex`, etc.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:57
msgid "Routing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:59
msgid ""
"Conversions that don't have an _explicitly_ defined conversion (in "
"[conversions.js](conversions.js)), but can be converted by means of sub-"
"conversions (e.g. XYZ -> **RGB** -> CMYK), are automatically routed "
"together. This allows just about any color model supported by `color-"
"convert` to be converted to any other model, so long as a sub-conversion "
"path exists. This is also true for conversions requiring more than one "
"step in between (e.g. LCH -> **LAB** -> **XYZ** -> **RGB** -> Hex)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:61
msgid ""
"Keep in mind that extensive conversions _may_ result in a loss of "
"precision, and exist only to be complete. For a list of \"direct\" "
"(single-step) conversions, see [conversions.js](conversions.js)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:63
msgid "Contribute"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/color-convert_README.md:65
msgid ""
"If there is a new model you would like to support, or want to add a "
"direct conversion between two existing models, please send us a pull "
"request."
msgstr ""

